    // Hit arc = the weapon (Mark 2026-11-23: "the club's arc is far too large, make it the same length as the weapon").
    // meleeOverrides reach puts the arc on the held blade. Measured from the baked strike clips (create_sword_anims.py -- path):
    // the fist travels ~0.31 m out from the swing pivot, the hand sits 12 % up the handle (basicplayer MeleeDemoStickGripAlongLength),
    // so reach = (0.53 + 0.88 x model length) / 1.14. club 0.68 m -> 0.99, bone sword 0.83 m -> 1.1, scrap sword 0.94 m -> 1.19,
    // reforged sword 1.0 m -> 1.24, stone axe 0.72 m -> 1.02, reforged axe 1.01 m -> 1.25 (class value 1.54).
    // Axes swing and block like the swords for now (Mark 2026-11-23); they stay harvest tools.
